  <Fragment slot="service-rows">
    <section class="Intro_intro__B7xXJ"><div class="container"><h2><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>Full-stack engineering for the next financial internet.</span></span></h2><div class="Intro_text__4DPtt prose"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span><p>Exchanges, wallets, RWA platforms, DeFi protocols, AI agents and the infrastructure underneath. Shipped into production, audited, live.</p>
</span></span></div></div></section><section class="TextImageRows_textImageRows__lOU02"><div class="container"><div class="TextImageRows_row__PPlpB"><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><h3 class="TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>Exchange development.</span></span></h3><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span><p>Centralized and decentralized venues built to institutional standards — matching engine, custody integrations, compliance stack, liquidity partners. Shipped with audits, not with demos.</p>
