</span></span></div><div class="TextImageRows_buttonContainer___PqVy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="Magnetic_magnetic__LncOy" data-fill="false"><div class="Button_button__JJiqJ" data-direction="forwards"><a class="Button_inner__fnyH6" href="/services/development/wallet"><span class="Button_border__hirH2"></span><span class="Button_text__IZaCD"><span class="Button_textInner__JTTHe">Find out more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 17.1 15.17" class="Button_buttonArrow__0W9XI"><path d="m17.1,7.58s-.01-.04-.01-.06c.01-.22-.06-.45-.24-.61L9.23.19c-.31-.27-.78-.24-1.06.07-.27.31-.24.78.07,1.06l6.26,5.52H.75c-.41,0-.75.34-.75.75s.34.75.75.75h13.74l-6.26,5.52c-.31.27-.34.75-.07,1.06.15.17.35.25.56.25.18,0,.35-.06.5-.19l7.62-6.72c.18-.16.25-.39.24-.61,0-.02.01-.04.01-.06Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></span></div></div><figure class="TextImageRows_media__twu3R"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="true"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data- data-src="/images/web-dev-2.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1224" width="1224" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></figure></div><div class="TextImageRows_row__PPlpB"><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><h3 class="TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>RWA marketplaces.</span></span></h3><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span><p>Real-world asset tokenization platforms — private credit, commodities, real estate, treasuries. Issuance, compliance, secondary markets. Built for institutions that won't touch retail-grade code.</p>
</span></span></div><div class="TextImageRows_buttonContainer___PqVy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="Magnetic_magnetic__LncOy" data-fill="false"><div class="Button_button__JJiqJ" data-direction="forwards"><a class="Button_inner__fnyH6" href="/services/development/rwa"><span class="Button_border__hirH2"></span><span class="Button_text__IZaCD"><span class="Button_textInner__JTTHe">Find out more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 17.1 15.17" class="Button_buttonArrow__0W9XI"><path d="m17.1,7.58s-.01-.04-.01-.06c.01-.22-.06-.45-.24-.61L9.23.19c-.31-.27-.78-.24-1.06.07-.27.31-.24.78.07,1.06l6.26,5.52H.75c-.41,0-.75.34-.75.75s.34.75.75.75h13.74l-6.26,5.52c-.31.27-.34.75-.07,1.06.15.17.35.25.56.25.18,0,.35-.06.5-.19l7.62-6.72c.18-.16.25-.39.24-.61,0-.02.01-.04.01-.06Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></span></div></div><figure class="TextImageRows_media__twu3R"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="true"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data- data-src="/images/copywriting-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1224" width="1224" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></figure></div><div class="TextImageRows_row__PPlpB"><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><h3 class="TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>DeFi &amp; staking.</span></span></h3><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span><p>Lending, DEXs, yield protocols, staking and restaking stacks. Solidity and Rust smart contracts engineered, audited by top firms, and deployed across Ethereum, Solana, TON and modular rollups.</p>
</span></span></div><div class="TextImageRows_buttonContainer___PqVy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="Magnetic_magnetic__LncOy" data-fill="false"><div class="Button_button__JJiqJ" data-direction="forwards"><a class="Button_inner__fnyH6" href="/services/development/defi"><span class="Button_border__hirH2"></span><span class="Button_text__IZaCD"><span class="Button_textInner__JTTHe">Find out more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 17.1 15.17" class="Button_buttonArrow__0W9XI"><path d="m17.1,7.58s-.01-.04-.01-.06c.01-.22-.06-.45-.24-.61L9.23.19c-.31-.27-.78-.24-1.06.07-.27.31-.24.78.07,1.06l6.26,5.52H.75c-.41,0-.75.34-.75.75s.34.75.75.75h13.74l-6.26,5.52c-.31.27-.34.75-.07,1.06.15.17.35.25.56.25.18,0,.35-.06.5-.19l7.62-6.72c.18-.16.25-.39.24-.61,0-.02.01-.04.01-.06Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></span></div></div><figure class="TextImageRows_media__twu3R"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="true"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data- data-src="/images/e-commerce.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1224" width="1224" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></figure></div><div class="TextImageRows_row__PPlpB"><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><h3 class="TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>AI solutions.</span></span></h3><div class="TextImageRows_text__bRCSP"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span><p>AI agents, copilots and LLM pipelines — wired to on-chain data, customer records and revenue workflows. RAG, fine-tuning, agentic orchestration, inference infrastructure.</p>
</span></span></div><div class="TextImageRows_buttonContainer___PqVy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="Magnetic_magnetic__LncOy" data-fill="false"><div class="Button_button__JJiqJ" data-direction="forwards"><a class="Button_inner__fnyH6" href="/services/development/ai"><span class="Button_border__hirH2"></span><span class="Button_text__IZaCD"><span class="Button_textInner__JTTHe">Find out more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 17.1 15.17" class="Button_buttonArrow__0W9XI"><path d="m17.1,7.58s-.01-.04-.01-.06c.01-.22-.06-.45-.24-.61L9.23.19c-.31-.27-.78-.24-1.06.07-.27.31-.24.78.07,1.06l6.26,5.52H.75c-.41,0-.75.34-.75.75s.34.75.75.75h13.74l-6.26,5.52c-.31.27-.34.75-.07,1.06.15.17.35.25.56.25.18,0,.35-.06.5-.19l7.62-6.72c.18-.16.25-.39.24-.61,0-.02.01-.04.01-.06Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></span></div></div><figure class="TextImageRows_media__twu3R"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="true"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data- data-src="/images/wordpress-1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="2160" width="2160" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></figure></div></div></section>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="timeline">
    <section class="Timeline_timeline__KvsOC" data-c8-timeline="vertical"><div class="container"><div class="Timeline_headings__PF6gg"><p class="Timeline_heading__JBlOu"><span class="LineByLine_headingOuter__JmusT"><span>How engagements run.</span></span></p><p class="Timeline_subheading__IVqa_"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><span>A typical phase breakdown — scope, sign-off and ship gates at each step. Actual durations depend on complexity, compliance depth and integration count.</span></span></p></div><div class="Timeline_scroller__D0iTE"><div class="StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm"><div class="Timeline_inner__J706Z"><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow3.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Immersion</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">1 week</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Ahead of the website kick off we&#x27;ll immerse ourselves in your brief, company, and scope of work. We&#x27;ll carry out competitor and industry analysis, a brand audit and start formulating a first draft of a sitemap. We&#x27;ll mood board some visual concept directions if needed for the kick off. We&#x27;ll also formulate your Corum8 team.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Research</span><span>Competitor Analysis</span><span>Industry Analysis</span><span>Mood Boards</span><span>Sitemap Creation</span><span>Formulate Corum8 Team</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow1.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Kick Off Meeting</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">3 hours</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">After an initial intro call to say hi, we will prepare a timeline of milestones, starting with a ‘Kick Off’ meeting with key stakeholders and the Corum8 team assigned to your project. Here we will discuss a range of points so we can get started soon after, including project goals, functionality, inspiration and website structure.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Workshop</span><span>Workshop Playback</span><span>Project Timeline</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow2.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Structure (UX)</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">2 weeks</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">The most important part of any website is having a clear and concise structure in order for users to be able to find the relevant content quickly and easily. We&#x27;ll wireframe your website as a clickable prototype, ensuring your content is structured correctly, creating a user experience that is engaging and intuitive. </p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Sitemap Validation</span><span>User Mapping</span><span>Information Architecture</span><span>UX Design</span><span>Wireframing</span><span>Prototyping</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow3.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Design (UI)</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">3 weeks</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">From the Wireframes we produce, we will then design either bespoke templates for each page of the website (in mobile and desktop resolutions), or look to design a component builder approach. The designs will be prototyped with minimal micro-animations, and show examples of more complex animations.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>UI Design</span><span>Prototyping</span><span>Animations</span><span>Mobile &amp; Desktop Resolutions</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow4.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>Development</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">4 weeks</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Once the design for all the page templates has been signed off, we will produce a Functional Specification for the website. This will outline the functionality and features of each page so you know what will be delivered. We&#x27;ll begin the web development using the appropriate technology for the front and back ends. </p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Functional Spec</span><span>CMS Development</span><span>Front End Development</span><span>Marketing Integrations</span><span>Website Animations</span></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_block__WRSOn" data-animation="grid-item"><figure class="Timeline_image__txoKz"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="" data-src="/images/workflow5.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="426" width="426" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></figure><div><p class="Timeline_blockHeading__hif7t"><span>QA &amp; Launch</span><span class="Timeline_duration__We5gA">2 weeks</span></p><p class="Timeline_blockText__RV__j">Before delivering you a beta link of the finished website, we will test and do quality assurance across all website browsers and devices. We will also implement a Technical SEO so your site is fully optimised for Google. After your final feedback we&#x27;ll migrate the site to the live server and offer a 30 day fix guarantee.</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolved__Z_cYT"><p>Work involved</p><div class="Timeline_workInvolvedList__CKLML"><span>Browser Testing</span><span>Device Testing</span><span>Technical SEO</span><span>301 Re-directs</span><span>Migrate to Live Sever</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Timeline_bottomTimeline__2F2yN" data-animation="grid-item"><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->1</span></div><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->1</span></div><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->2</span></div><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->5</span></div><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->9</span></div><div class="Timeline_blockTime__5jxQS"><span class="Timeline_weekNumber__qqgnG">Week <!-- -->12</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
  </Fragment>
</ServicePillarLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Website workflow — real vertical timeline with numbered nodes, a
     continuous spine, and step cards flowing to the right. Reads as a
     sequence of stations, with generous breathing room between each step. */
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_scroller__D0iTE {
    overflow: visible !important;
    height: auto !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_scroller__D0iTE .StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm {
    display: block !important;
    height: auto !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    min-width: 0 !important;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_headings__PF6gg {
    margin: 0 auto clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) !important;
    max-width: 1080px;
    padding-left: 5rem !important;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_inner__J706Z {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: column !important;
    gap: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    transform: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    counter-reset: c8timeline;
    position: relative;
  }
  /* Continuous spine behind the nodes. */
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_inner__J706Z::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 31px;
    top: 24px;
    bottom: 24px;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 0%,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.14) 60%,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_block__WRSOn {
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: none !important;
    flex: unset !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 0 3.75rem 5.25rem !important;
    display: block !important;
    position: relative;
    counter-increment: c8timeline;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_block__WRSOn:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  /* Numbered node on the spine — floats freely, no halo ring. */
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_block__WRSOn::before {
    content: counter(c8timeline, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 4px;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    z-index: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    transition: transform 0.35s ease, background 0.35s ease;
  }
  [data-c8-timeline="vertical"] .Timeline_block__WRSOn:hover::before {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }
